Better Newsgroups for The Major BBS v10
Copyright (C) 2026 Sysop Network.  Released under the MIT License.

A two-way gateway between Usenet newsgroups and the BBS forums.

SETTING UP
  1. Create a forum for each newsgroup, with the usual forum tools.
  2. Add Better Newsgroups to the menu (Sysop only) and enter it.
  3. Settings 2-7: the news server, port, security and login your
     news provider gave you.
  4. G: link each newsgroup to its forum.  Import copies articles into
     the forum; Export posts what users write in the forum.
  5. Setting 1 to YES, then C to check right away.

All settings are changed online and apply at once; there are no CNF
options.  The Audit Trail records problems (and, if asked, activity).

FILES
  SNBETNWS.DLL/.MDF/.MSG   the module
  SNBETNWS.DAT             settings and newsgroup links (created)
  SNBETMID.DAT             Message-ID cross-reference (created)
  SNBETNWS\IN, \OUT        articles waiting to be imported / posted
  SNBETNWS.LOG             optional server transcript (setting 24)

